WEBVTT

01:26.530 --> 01:29.750
[Glory]

01:30.480 --> 01:32.910
[Episode 36]

01:40.710 --> 01:41.430
It was me.

01:42.680 --> 01:44.539
I was the one who killed Xue Shuyu.

01:55.430 --> 01:56.950
You wicked woman!

01:57.039 --> 01:58.430
I knew it was you!

01:58.430 --> 01:58.870
Madam,

01:59.479 --> 02:01.070
don't speak rashly out of anger.

02:01.070 --> 02:02.530
You can't just
confess to crimes recklessly.

02:02.530 --> 02:03.370
Xue Maotang.

02:04.270 --> 02:06.130
You've neglected me for 20 years.

02:06.230 --> 02:08.289
Now that I've killed one of your sons,

02:08.500 --> 02:10.630
it's actually letting you off easily.

02:10.710 --> 02:12.110
It's just that back then,

02:12.800 --> 02:13.910
I should have

02:15.190 --> 02:17.000
killed this honey-tongued

02:17.390 --> 02:18.829
and evil-hearted

02:18.860 --> 02:19.970
woman, too.

02:21.360 --> 02:22.490
I didn't expect that

02:22.750 --> 02:24.710
she would turn into a venomous snake today

02:24.710 --> 02:25.680
and bite me back.

02:26.270 --> 02:28.320
I shouldn't have pitied you at that time.

02:28.320 --> 02:29.750
I pitied you
for being a widow as a young girl,

02:29.750 --> 02:31.550
so I often showed you extra care.

02:32.120 --> 02:32.920
Just let it be.

02:34.470 --> 02:36.150
I was truly as blind as a bat.

02:37.160 --> 02:39.690
It was my own fault
for misjudging this woman.

02:40.400 --> 02:41.120
I am...

02:42.630 --> 02:44.000
the real blind one here.

02:45.750 --> 02:46.750
At this point,

02:47.590 --> 02:49.520
I'll let you decide what to do to me.

02:50.190 --> 02:52.190
But we've been husband and wife
for many years,

02:52.190 --> 02:53.430
and I know a big secret

02:53.430 --> 02:54.750
about Your Highness.

02:55.240 --> 02:56.870
I suppose trading this secret

02:56.870 --> 02:58.190
for my own life

02:58.860 --> 03:00.390
would still be worthwhile.

03:02.400 --> 03:04.250
Stop playing tricks here.

03:05.770 --> 03:07.530
Do you think I would trust you?

03:09.560 --> 03:11.030
Don't you want to know

03:11.030 --> 03:13.400
why Madam Han passed away
in her prime years,

03:13.400 --> 03:15.030
being unable to wait for your

03:15.360 --> 03:16.490
triumphant return?

03:29.800 --> 03:30.520
Tell me.

03:44.240 --> 03:45.100
Your Highness!

03:45.710 --> 03:46.570
Your Highness!

03:47.030 --> 03:47.750
Your Highness!

03:47.750 --> 03:48.680
-Madam!
-Madam!

03:49.510 --> 03:50.370
Your Highness!

03:51.590 --> 03:52.390
Hurry! Hurry!

03:53.680 --> 03:54.210
Hurry up!

03:57.470 --> 03:58.329
Your Highness!

03:58.750 --> 03:59.610
Your Highness!

04:00.510 --> 04:02.370
Endure the pain! Endure the pain!

04:06.240 --> 04:07.000
Madam!

04:08.130 --> 04:09.280
Xue Maotang!

04:10.840 --> 04:12.240
So you know the pain, too?

04:12.350 --> 04:13.080
Hurry up!

04:13.080 --> 04:13.680
How I wish I could...

04:13.680 --> 04:14.240
Hurry up!

04:14.590 --> 04:15.030
How I wish I could

04:15.030 --> 04:16.600
bite your entire ear off!

04:17.510 --> 04:18.570
For these 20 years,

04:19.810 --> 04:21.410
you've resented and hated me

04:21.920 --> 04:23.340
while I've been painstakingly
managing the household

04:23.340 --> 04:24.340
for you.

04:24.890 --> 04:26.220
But you couldn't see it.

04:26.600 --> 04:27.870
Nor could you hear it!

04:28.680 --> 04:29.740
For these 20 years,

04:30.190 --> 04:31.990
I've sacrificed so much for you.

04:33.310 --> 04:34.890
But in the end,

04:36.270 --> 04:37.360
you, Xue Maotang,

04:37.360 --> 04:38.720
wouldn't even give me

04:38.720 --> 04:40.310
a house to live in.

04:40.950 --> 04:42.040
And now,

04:43.480 --> 04:44.810
you actually want to...

04:45.950 --> 04:47.600
you actually want to frame me

04:47.600 --> 04:49.040
and kill me.

04:50.270 --> 04:51.600
If you want me to die,

04:52.070 --> 04:53.510
I can die.

04:54.950 --> 04:55.600
But I refuse

04:55.600 --> 04:57.120
to die like your Madam Han,

04:57.630 --> 04:59.960
who passed away silently without a trace!

05:02.560 --> 05:03.870
Even till now, you still don't know

05:03.870 --> 05:05.750
how Madam Han died, do you?

05:07.790 --> 05:09.040
She was...

05:10.660 --> 05:12.500
She was worn down by you to death.

05:13.080 --> 05:14.540
Your houseful of concubines made her

05:14.540 --> 05:16.110
so angry that she died!

05:20.370 --> 05:21.890
If you want me to die today,

05:23.040 --> 05:24.370
I'll die in front of you.

05:25.160 --> 05:26.220
But let me tell you.

05:27.750 --> 05:29.080
We are all human beings.

05:30.120 --> 05:31.360
We are not stones.

05:31.800 --> 05:33.270
Nor are we tools!

05:33.390 --> 05:35.040
We are living people!

05:35.430 --> 05:37.190
I would laugh and cry.

05:37.190 --> 05:38.920
I would also be weak sometimes.

05:39.270 --> 05:41.000
And I have feelings, too!

05:45.480 --> 05:46.480
Fine.

05:47.190 --> 05:48.270
You want to die?

05:49.040 --> 05:50.330
I'll grant your wish!

05:51.830 --> 05:52.720
Come on!

05:53.070 --> 05:53.720
Come on!

05:53.720 --> 05:54.560
Your Highness!

05:54.560 --> 05:55.000
No!

05:55.090 --> 05:55.890
Don't do this!

05:56.000 --> 05:56.830
Step aside!

05:56.920 --> 05:57.780
Your Highness!

05:58.000 --> 05:59.360
She's a second-rank titled lady.

05:59.360 --> 06:00.630
No matter what crimes she has committed,

06:00.630 --> 06:02.280
she must be tried according to the law.

06:02.280 --> 06:03.440
Your Highness, do you really

06:03.440 --> 06:05.430
want to kill a titled lady illegally?

06:05.430 --> 06:06.600
You rebellious son!

06:07.430 --> 06:09.600
She killed your own brother
with her plots.

06:09.600 --> 06:10.950
Are you still trying to help her

06:10.950 --> 06:12.150
harm your own father?

06:12.830 --> 06:13.680
Step aside!

06:15.080 --> 06:16.140
You brute!

06:19.870 --> 06:20.480
Bad news!

06:20.870 --> 06:21.530
Miss Sun...

06:21.970 --> 06:23.500
Miss Sun fell into the lake!

06:43.850 --> 06:44.510
Good child.

06:45.480 --> 06:46.610
Go find your mother.

06:47.170 --> 06:47.900
Mother!

06:52.600 --> 06:54.310
Yu, are you alright?

06:54.680 --> 06:56.000
Aunt's little dog

06:56.030 --> 06:57.560
fell into the pond just now.

06:57.680 --> 06:59.070
I wanted to pull it out,

06:59.430 --> 07:01.430
but I carelessly fell into the pond.

07:01.440 --> 07:02.040
Xiu Qiong.

07:02.360 --> 07:03.680
Luckily, Miss Rong was passing by

07:03.680 --> 07:04.800
and pulled me out.

07:05.720 --> 07:07.650
Fortunately, the dog is fine, too.

07:08.560 --> 07:10.020
I'm glad you're both fine.

07:18.220 --> 07:19.200
As a mother,

07:20.240 --> 07:21.120
one should

07:21.120 --> 07:22.800
set a good example for her children.

07:22.800 --> 07:24.510
Murder and false accusations

07:25.120 --> 07:25.950
are things that we shouldn't

07:25.950 --> 07:27.410
let the children witness.

07:29.750 --> 07:30.430
Mrs. Xue,

07:31.190 --> 07:31.830
you'd better ask someone

07:31.830 --> 07:33.430
to escort Miss Sun back home.

07:34.120 --> 07:35.440
Lian Xin, hurry!

07:35.470 --> 07:35.960
Yes.

07:37.390 --> 07:37.850
Come on.

07:45.000 --> 07:46.710
The sea of suffering is boundless,

07:46.710 --> 07:48.630
but salvation awaits those who turn back.

07:48.630 --> 07:49.760
Princess Jinxiang,

07:50.520 --> 07:51.030
was he

07:51.950 --> 07:53.750
truly killed by the duke's wife?

07:59.700 --> 08:00.460
Miss Rong.

08:02.270 --> 08:03.730
You're truly impressive.

08:21.950 --> 08:22.680
I did it.

08:24.430 --> 08:25.160
Xue Shuyu

08:26.250 --> 08:27.180
was killed by me.

08:28.310 --> 08:29.680
Yingchuan, you...

08:30.090 --> 08:31.150
Why did you do that?

08:32.630 --> 08:33.830
I originally planned

08:34.000 --> 08:35.730
to blame everything on Mother.

08:36.320 --> 08:38.320
After all, Father didn't care for her,

08:38.320 --> 08:39.510
and she was already terminally ill.

08:39.510 --> 08:39.870
Madam.

08:39.870 --> 08:41.200
So what if she takes the blame

08:41.200 --> 08:42.200
for all my crimes?

08:42.600 --> 08:43.510
Who knew

08:44.970 --> 08:46.630
she would be so strong-willed

08:48.120 --> 08:49.650
and cause such big trouble?

08:51.060 --> 08:52.790
Now I feel a bit guilty instead.

08:54.260 --> 08:55.390
I don't understand.

08:56.680 --> 08:58.220
You were obviously on such good terms

08:58.220 --> 08:58.880
with Shuyu.

09:00.440 --> 09:01.240
Why did you...

09:05.720 --> 09:06.850
Others may not know,

09:08.480 --> 09:10.010
but don't you know, Father?

09:12.510 --> 09:13.670
You certainly know.

09:14.670 --> 09:15.340
Back then,

09:16.720 --> 09:18.240
you personally ordered

09:19.550 --> 09:20.870
Xue Shuyu to take some men

09:20.870 --> 09:22.440
to capture Mr. Wang and me.

09:23.120 --> 09:24.080
Then you sent him

09:24.080 --> 09:26.080
to the most dangerous battlefield,

09:26.150 --> 09:28.150
causing him to die in a battle there.

09:28.200 --> 09:30.480
You also took my newborn daughter

09:31.840 --> 09:32.790
away from me.

09:33.200 --> 09:35.510
She was only 7 days old!

09:36.030 --> 09:37.600
Just 7 days old!

09:39.180 --> 09:40.240
Your purpose was just to

09:40.240 --> 09:41.270
quickly force me into

09:41.270 --> 09:43.080
another man's bridal sedan.

09:43.630 --> 09:45.910
I cried and begged.

09:46.330 --> 09:48.180
But you all refused to spare me.

09:48.630 --> 09:50.120
You are my own father.

09:51.630 --> 09:53.890
My own younger brother did the same, too.

09:54.370 --> 09:56.250
No one was willing to spare me.

09:57.020 --> 09:58.880
Since you all wanted me to suffer,

09:59.270 --> 10:01.200
then no one could live peacefully!

10:07.440 --> 10:08.040
You...

10:12.400 --> 10:12.920
You...

10:18.480 --> 10:19.550
Xue Maotang!

10:19.900 --> 10:21.080
Stop saying you.

10:22.230 --> 10:23.830
All the members of the family

10:24.400 --> 10:26.660
have been forced by you into such a state.

10:27.270 --> 10:28.720
You're so nice.

10:43.520 --> 10:44.170
You all...

10:49.170 --> 10:50.030
Your Highness!

11:09.030 --> 11:11.830
Hurry! Hurry!
Take him back to the Baoshi Hall now!

11:23.000 --> 11:24.730
Madam, your illness is severe,

11:25.120 --> 11:27.180
and you've been wrongfully accused.

11:27.370 --> 11:28.870
It's understandable that you're outraged

11:28.870 --> 11:30.270
and acting impulsively.

11:30.500 --> 11:33.390
This is all because of the duke's
arbitrary actions that have harmed others.

11:33.390 --> 11:34.520
Please go back first

11:34.570 --> 11:36.100
and focus on your recovery.

11:50.790 --> 11:52.120
As for Xue Yingchuan...

11:54.000 --> 11:55.200
Ever since Yingchuan

11:55.760 --> 11:57.170
lost her child,

11:58.080 --> 12:00.210
she has been suffering from hysteria.

12:00.290 --> 12:00.920
Whenever she saw

12:00.920 --> 12:02.320
Master Shuyu and the duke,

12:02.320 --> 12:04.390
she would always talk about killing them.

12:04.390 --> 12:06.650
She hasn't had an relapse for many years.

12:06.860 --> 12:08.790
I thought she had fully recovered.

12:09.550 --> 12:10.750
But seeing her today,

12:11.480 --> 12:13.200
I'm afraid she's having a relapse again.

12:13.200 --> 12:13.840
Otherwise, how would she

12:13.840 --> 12:15.970
be unable to recognize her own brother

12:16.030 --> 12:17.200
and even kill him?

12:23.630 --> 12:24.320
The duke

12:24.840 --> 12:26.900
probably cannot make a decision now.

12:27.430 --> 12:29.630
Sending the culprit to the police
would be inappropriate.

12:29.630 --> 12:30.440
After all, the duke

12:30.440 --> 12:32.240
cares deeply about his reputation.

12:32.240 --> 12:34.460
With his wife's and children's
resentment and madness,

12:34.460 --> 12:36.270
which might cause a scene in court,

12:36.270 --> 12:38.670
wouldn't it become a laughingstock
of the entire city?

12:38.670 --> 12:39.480
You'd better

12:39.840 --> 12:42.100
handle this problem at your discretion.

12:50.180 --> 12:52.110
She indeed suffers from hysteria,

12:52.190 --> 12:54.370
but murder is such a serious crime
that she can't be pardoned.

12:54.370 --> 12:56.370
Send her to the family temple first,

12:56.510 --> 12:58.170
and find a doctor to treat her.

12:58.260 --> 12:59.720
When her illness is cured,

12:59.840 --> 13:01.900
she will face punishment for murder.

13:03.750 --> 13:05.350
What are you all waiting for?

13:12.440 --> 13:13.370
Although Ji Ping

13:13.750 --> 13:15.550
also tampered with the brazier,

13:15.960 --> 13:17.820
she's not the main culprit after all.

13:17.820 --> 13:19.270
How should we deal with her?

13:19.270 --> 13:20.800
Though she didn't kill him,

13:21.330 --> 13:23.260
she did put the Valley Lily into it.

13:23.360 --> 13:23.910
Send her to

13:23.910 --> 13:25.510
the estate outside the city.

13:25.800 --> 13:28.400
Sentence her
to five years of penal servitude.

13:29.960 --> 13:31.160
Jianglai, Miss Rong,

13:31.750 --> 13:32.480
thank you

13:32.480 --> 13:34.080
for upholding justice here.

13:34.360 --> 13:36.390
Now that the truth has been uncovered,

13:36.390 --> 13:38.520
Master Shuyu can finally rest in peace

13:38.550 --> 13:39.720
in the netherworld.

13:41.550 --> 13:42.720
It's just that the duke

13:42.720 --> 13:44.550
cannot manage affairs for the time being.

13:44.550 --> 13:45.210
From now on,

13:46.160 --> 13:48.220
this grand Duke of Yongguo's Mansion

13:50.240 --> 13:52.770
will depend entirely
on your care, Jianglai.

14:15.590 --> 14:16.320
Huiqing.

14:25.840 --> 14:27.080
Shuyu's death...

14:37.710 --> 14:38.710
You may leave now.

15:16.030 --> 15:17.550
If there's anything in here

15:17.550 --> 15:18.600
that you like,

15:19.100 --> 15:19.910
just take it.

15:28.600 --> 15:30.000
Such nice knee pads.

15:30.120 --> 15:31.980
Does Madam not want them anymore?

15:41.320 --> 15:42.030
Yeah.

15:42.720 --> 15:44.050
From now on, these items

15:44.630 --> 15:46.120
will never be used again.

16:18.670 --> 16:19.530
Your Highness.

16:25.300 --> 16:26.870
Your Highness! Your Highness!

16:26.870 --> 16:27.930
Please be careful.

16:28.320 --> 16:29.180
Your Highness.

16:29.360 --> 16:31.390
The liver is the organ of wind and wood.

16:31.390 --> 16:33.480
Irritability and rage
would cause internal liver wind,

16:33.480 --> 16:35.120
and your stroke would become worse.

16:35.120 --> 16:36.360
Even the greatest immortals

16:36.360 --> 16:37.690
couldn't save you then.

16:38.120 --> 16:39.320
I don't need a doctor.

16:39.670 --> 16:40.150
Get out!

16:42.200 --> 16:43.660
Ask Jianglai to come here.

16:44.720 --> 16:45.630
Just go!

17:19.790 --> 17:20.510
Last night,

17:22.720 --> 17:24.319
my brother apologized to me.

17:28.069 --> 17:29.110
I thought

17:32.070 --> 17:35.000
we would still
have much time together in the future.

17:35.070 --> 17:35.670
Jianglai.

17:37.130 --> 17:38.530
Master Shuyu's death...

17:44.850 --> 17:45.580
Don't say it.

17:48.580 --> 17:49.710
Don't say anything.

17:51.270 --> 17:51.800
Alright.

17:53.590 --> 17:55.520
Let's both remain muddle-headed.

18:15.030 --> 18:16.030
Master Jianglai.

18:20.320 --> 18:22.440
Your Highness,
why have you summoned me here?

18:22.440 --> 18:24.840
You don't need to
be so alert to everything.

18:25.350 --> 18:27.410
I'm not trying to argue with you here.

18:28.110 --> 18:29.420
I used to believe

18:30.070 --> 18:32.590
a real man
should aspire to conquer the world

18:32.590 --> 18:34.600
rather than worry about household matters.

18:34.600 --> 18:36.530
Only until now have I realized that

18:36.780 --> 18:37.840
in this household,

18:38.160 --> 18:39.830
everyone resents me.

18:40.880 --> 18:42.720
I'm a bad husband

18:43.640 --> 18:45.000
and a bad father.

18:45.920 --> 18:47.110
As for your brother's incident,

18:47.110 --> 18:48.790
I don't want to pursue it anymore.

18:48.790 --> 18:50.030
It's up to you

18:50.030 --> 18:50.960
how to handle it.

18:51.550 --> 18:53.480
Tomorrow, I'll submit a memorial,

18:53.680 --> 18:54.740
asking His Majesty

18:55.070 --> 18:56.920
to let you be the duke's heir

18:57.500 --> 19:00.160
so that you can rightfully
return to our family.

19:00.640 --> 19:02.070
When I can walk again,

19:02.510 --> 19:03.400
let's

19:03.590 --> 19:05.050
go to Jiangnan personally

19:05.750 --> 19:07.880
to move your mother's grave back here.

19:08.350 --> 19:10.350
Though I know it's too late,

19:10.560 --> 19:12.030
it might at least slightly make up for

19:12.030 --> 19:13.200
the guilt in my mind

19:13.720 --> 19:14.920
and your regrets.

19:23.640 --> 19:25.900
What exactly do you want, Your Highness?

19:27.390 --> 19:28.520
Just speak frankly.

19:31.510 --> 19:32.640
I'm getting old now.

19:34.400 --> 19:35.720
My shoulders can no longer bear

19:35.720 --> 19:37.650
the weight of this Duke's Mansion.

19:38.640 --> 19:39.300
From now on,

19:40.510 --> 19:42.370
I'd like to entrust the Xue family

19:43.110 --> 19:44.400
and this child

19:45.070 --> 19:46.400
to you.

19:50.480 --> 19:51.160
Xun.

19:51.710 --> 19:53.370
Go bow to your Uncle Jianglai.

19:57.200 --> 19:58.130
Uncle Jianglai.

20:01.480 --> 20:02.410
No need for this.

20:06.590 --> 20:07.450
Your Highness.

20:08.700 --> 20:11.310
The person who you should apologize to
has passed away.

20:11.310 --> 20:13.110
Why do you have to put on this act?

20:13.920 --> 20:15.850
I'm sorry but I can't stay with you.

20:17.440 --> 20:18.930
Uncle Jianglai, don't go!

20:20.240 --> 20:21.640
If you insist on leaving,

20:22.230 --> 20:23.920
I know I can't keep you here.

20:25.240 --> 20:25.830
However,

20:26.730 --> 20:28.110
please think more about

20:28.110 --> 20:28.880
this child.

20:29.550 --> 20:31.120
He's only 7 years old.

20:31.750 --> 20:33.880
Forcing him to bear such a heavy burden

20:33.880 --> 20:34.790
will certainly

20:34.790 --> 20:36.990
crush his young and fragile shoulders.

20:37.000 --> 20:38.750
I know I'm not a good father.

20:39.430 --> 20:41.670
I've failed to
educate your brother properly.

20:41.670 --> 20:42.750
But can you bear to watch

20:42.750 --> 20:43.960
his only child

20:44.480 --> 20:45.480
also emulating him

20:45.480 --> 20:46.510
in the future?

20:54.350 --> 20:56.880
Uncle Jianglai, don't go!

20:57.030 --> 20:58.070
Father is dead.

20:58.900 --> 21:00.100
I'm so scared.

21:00.720 --> 21:02.370
Could you please

21:02.400 --> 21:03.480
stay with me?

21:04.160 --> 21:05.480
Uncle Jianglai!

21:06.920 --> 21:08.750
I'm begging you!

21:09.070 --> 21:10.440
Uncle Jianglai!

21:12.720 --> 21:14.590
Uncle Jianglai!

21:26.140 --> 21:27.820
Uncle Jianglai!

21:40.800 --> 21:45.780
[Imperial Yongguo Mansion]

21:44.350 --> 21:45.000
Wait!

21:51.070 --> 21:51.590
Yu.

21:52.550 --> 21:53.680
Your auntie is leaving.

21:53.680 --> 21:54.880
Go say goodbye to her.

22:00.880 --> 22:01.790
Auntie.

22:03.370 --> 22:04.370
Stay away from me.

22:11.200 --> 22:12.640
Don't live like I did.

22:51.740 --> 22:53.740
All of you, put these away properly.

22:53.830 --> 22:54.490
-Yes.
-Yes.

22:54.680 --> 22:55.110
Yes.

23:04.110 --> 23:04.970
Your Highness.

23:05.730 --> 23:07.010
Clean up everything

23:07.070 --> 23:08.070
in the courtyard.

23:09.020 --> 23:10.510
Don't leave any old items here.

23:10.510 --> 23:10.960
Yes.

23:11.640 --> 23:12.350
I will make an inventory of them all

23:12.350 --> 23:14.080
and put them in the storehouse.

23:14.960 --> 23:16.820
There's no need for such trouble.

23:17.990 --> 23:19.050
Just burn them all.

23:26.830 --> 23:27.690
Your Highness.

23:27.910 --> 23:29.590
The Chi Dragon Pendant in this place

23:29.590 --> 23:31.200
was fastened to Master Shuyu's waist

23:31.200 --> 23:32.960
by you personally
during his coming-of-age ceremony.

23:32.960 --> 23:33.790
I noticed that

23:33.920 --> 23:34.880
Master Shuyu had kept it

23:34.880 --> 23:36.240
in a precious brocade box.

23:36.240 --> 23:36.830
I wonder

23:37.290 --> 23:38.350
how to deal with it.

23:39.160 --> 23:40.890
You've reminded me something.

23:43.240 --> 23:45.500
At Jianglai's coming-of-age ceremony,

23:45.920 --> 23:47.450
I didn't give him anything.

23:49.830 --> 23:50.720
Go to the storehouse

23:50.720 --> 23:52.720
and select the finest piece of jade.

23:55.270 --> 23:55.750
Yes.

24:08.030 --> 24:09.030
You may leave now.

24:10.640 --> 24:11.240
Yes.

24:52.120 --> 24:52.920
Lady Shanbao.

24:53.400 --> 24:54.030
Lady Yunshu said

24:54.030 --> 24:55.960
she would
personally escort you to the dock.

24:55.960 --> 24:57.090
Shall we depart now?

24:57.880 --> 24:58.480
I got it.

24:59.480 --> 24:59.960
Wait!

25:01.350 --> 25:02.150
Rong Shanbao.

25:02.680 --> 25:03.610
What do you mean?

25:03.750 --> 25:04.880
Are you leaving now?

25:06.160 --> 25:06.640
Are you really going to

25:06.640 --> 25:07.770
leave me alone here?

25:08.360 --> 25:09.760
What exactly do you mean?

25:10.920 --> 25:12.180
Tell me, Rong Shanbao!

25:13.310 --> 25:14.510
You two may leave now.

25:17.160 --> 25:17.720
Yes.

25:32.240 --> 25:33.300
I'm talking to you.

25:34.440 --> 25:35.040
Jianglai.

25:36.000 --> 25:36.790
Listen to me.

25:38.270 --> 25:39.330
The Duke of Yongguo

25:39.880 --> 25:40.350
was once

25:40.350 --> 25:42.040
a devoted husband
who quite cherished his first wife.

25:42.040 --> 25:43.590
He withstood family pressure

25:43.590 --> 25:44.920
for his infertile wife.

25:46.480 --> 25:48.030
Though she passed away many years ago,

25:48.030 --> 25:49.760
he still hasn't forgotten her.

25:50.000 --> 25:51.920
Before my father came to the capital,

25:51.920 --> 25:53.450
he also had lofty ambitions

25:53.680 --> 25:54.740
with high spirits.

25:55.240 --> 25:55.830
He aspired to be

25:55.830 --> 25:57.720
a good official
that would be remembered in history.

25:57.720 --> 25:59.850
They weren't born to be so detestable,

26:00.310 --> 26:01.440
but as time went by,

26:01.880 --> 26:03.920
they became so different from
what they had been.

26:03.920 --> 26:05.510
You have your Duke's Mansion

26:05.510 --> 26:07.710
and family ties that you can't let go of.

26:08.110 --> 26:09.440
I don't hope to watch you

26:10.270 --> 26:11.480
become the arbitrary

26:12.310 --> 26:13.590
and annoying

26:14.480 --> 26:15.830
Duke of Yongguo one day.

26:16.640 --> 26:17.420
Rong Shanbao.

26:17.420 --> 26:18.750
You and I will stop here.

26:19.350 --> 26:20.410
In my mind, you will

26:21.000 --> 26:23.270
forever be that upright
and determined man,

26:23.270 --> 26:25.000
who never curries favor
with the powerful men

26:25.000 --> 26:26.420
and always remains wise, decisive,

26:26.420 --> 26:27.620
clever and adorable,

26:28.060 --> 26:30.460
just like the way you were
when we first met.

26:30.910 --> 26:31.590
So,

26:33.000 --> 26:34.160
please let me leave.

26:35.250 --> 26:36.360
Let our memories

26:37.440 --> 26:37.880
stay on this day

26:37.880 --> 26:39.210
when I love you the most.

26:39.310 --> 26:40.640
What if I don't allow it?

26:42.680 --> 26:45.210
Will you still continue
to look for a husband?

26:55.810 --> 26:57.610
I have my own responsibilities.

26:57.720 --> 26:59.250
But I will never forget you.

27:00.550 --> 27:01.680
In this lifetime,

27:02.350 --> 27:04.480
my love will never change until death.

27:25.790 --> 27:27.680
The Rong family's carriage
is already waiting outside.

27:27.680 --> 27:30.080
Are you really going to
let Miss Rong leave?

27:30.310 --> 27:31.110
I was even waiting for you

27:31.110 --> 27:32.350
to go back to Linji with me

27:32.350 --> 27:33.480
to achieve the aspirations
of eradicating corruption

27:33.480 --> 27:35.010
and benefiting the people.

27:35.060 --> 27:36.880
It turns out that I've waited in vain.

27:36.880 --> 27:38.440
The humble position of Prefect of Linji

27:38.440 --> 27:39.350
can hardly compare with

27:39.350 --> 27:41.160
this grand and luxurious Duke's Mansion.

27:41.160 --> 27:42.890
She has long intended to leave.

27:44.920 --> 27:45.440
On the first day

27:45.440 --> 27:47.640
when she arrived at the Duke's Mansion,

27:47.830 --> 27:48.350
she knew

27:48.350 --> 27:49.480
this day would come.

27:57.310 --> 27:58.270
How can there be

27:58.270 --> 28:00.330
such a heartless woman in this world?

28:00.790 --> 28:02.920
Even when she's saying goodbye to you,

28:03.240 --> 28:03.830
she still wouldn't forget to use

28:03.830 --> 28:05.760
the sweetest words to deceive you,

28:06.270 --> 28:07.680
making you unable to forget her,

28:07.680 --> 28:08.750
unwilling to hate her

28:08.750 --> 28:09.960
and even more unwilling
to become her enemy!

28:09.590 --> 28:12.850
♪ The music of fairies and jade flutes ♪

28:11.070 --> 28:11.750
She has done all these things

28:11.750 --> 28:12.880
just to get rid of me.

28:13.040 --> 28:17.680
♪ The wine in the cup is as clear
as jade dew with graceful sword dances ♪

28:13.920 --> 28:14.880
It's all a lie.

28:15.640 --> 28:16.880
Everything is a lie.

28:17.710 --> 28:20.760
♪ There are refined scholars
in white robes ♪

28:17.830 --> 28:18.830
She's such a liar!

28:22.240 --> 28:26.190
♪ The new hall is further adorned
with intricate gold carvings ♪

28:26.660 --> 28:29.270
♪ The sound of Konghou is echoing ♪

28:30.020 --> 28:34.930
♪ With a stroke of ink,
I wrote a poem to show my passion ♪

28:35.640 --> 28:39.430
♪ The jade-adorned robe and the long sword
embody grace and talent ♪

28:39.810 --> 28:42.180
♪ The mountains and rivers
never miss the past ♪

28:42.490 --> 28:48.440
♪ Writing poems to show my passion,
I have no worry ♪

29:15.400 --> 29:17.800
Miss Rong,
do you have something to tell me?

29:19.880 --> 29:20.760
Xuanyu

29:21.370 --> 29:23.970
is Princess Jinxiang's
biological daughter.

29:26.160 --> 29:27.160
My child died at the time

29:27.160 --> 29:28.030
of birth.

29:28.860 --> 29:30.920
I bribed those who worked for the duke

29:31.030 --> 29:33.030
and dealt with the girl's servants.

29:33.960 --> 29:35.760
I secretly switched the babies.

29:37.590 --> 29:39.740
Your grandfather
was the head of the Imperial Hospital.

29:39.740 --> 29:40.660
Mrs. Xue,

29:40.680 --> 29:42.740
you must be skilled in medicine, too.

29:43.200 --> 29:45.160
The rumor of the men-only inheritance

29:45.160 --> 29:46.560
is also groundless, huh?

29:47.200 --> 29:49.510
I merely learned the skills
through observation.

29:49.510 --> 29:51.110
Those are some insignificant skills.

29:51.110 --> 29:54.110
How would I dare to boast about them
in front of others?

29:55.030 --> 29:56.160
Miss Ji Ping

29:56.510 --> 29:57.200
also wasn't really

29:57.200 --> 29:58.790
at odds with you.

29:59.750 --> 30:00.750
That night,

30:00.750 --> 30:02.480
you told me about your feelings

30:02.480 --> 30:04.640
not because
we felt like old friends at first sight.

30:04.640 --> 30:06.440
You actually wanted to stall me.

30:08.680 --> 30:10.790
Lady Shanbao,
you've seen through everything.

30:10.790 --> 30:12.190
Why didn't you expose it?

30:13.000 --> 30:15.400
You didn't kill anyone
with your own hands.

30:15.680 --> 30:16.940
So what if I expose you?

30:18.110 --> 30:19.880
Master Shuyu's cruelty
to his wife and concubines

30:19.880 --> 30:21.080
is well-known to all.

30:21.510 --> 30:23.170
As someone with a conscience,

30:23.510 --> 30:25.510
Jianglai must be suffering the most

30:26.030 --> 30:28.100
because while being stuck in the dilemma,

30:28.100 --> 30:30.550
he has no choice but to
remain willfully ignorant like this.

30:30.550 --> 30:32.030
Only with all the endurance and plots

30:32.030 --> 30:34.030
did you manage to get what you wanted.

30:34.030 --> 30:35.160
Are you truly happy?

30:36.590 --> 30:37.350
Miss Rong,

30:38.510 --> 30:39.680
not everyone has the luck

30:39.680 --> 30:41.280
to be born in the Rong family.

30:41.750 --> 30:42.680
Also, not everyone has

30:42.680 --> 30:44.610
the freedom to live as they please.

30:46.000 --> 30:48.600
I don't have
the Founding Emperor's jade seal.

30:48.960 --> 30:49.790
Nor do I have a powerful natal family

30:49.790 --> 30:51.450
that's willing to support me.

30:52.720 --> 30:53.480
I don't even have

30:53.480 --> 30:55.410
a husband that's worth relying on.

30:56.070 --> 30:57.030
In this world,

30:58.160 --> 30:58.960
there isn't even

30:58.960 --> 31:00.890
a single person who truly loves me.

31:02.590 --> 31:03.850
But I must love myself.

31:04.720 --> 31:05.980
I must protect myself.

31:07.160 --> 31:09.490
And above all, I must protect my children.

31:10.000 --> 31:12.200
But I still have to thank you, Miss Rong.

31:12.460 --> 31:13.150
Thank you for never

31:13.150 --> 31:14.880
exposing me in front of others,

31:15.470 --> 31:17.870
despite having countless opportunities.

31:19.200 --> 31:21.460
The duke is still vigorous in his old age.

31:21.510 --> 31:22.400
Mrs. Xue,

31:22.960 --> 31:25.560
I'm afraid
you can't fulfill your wish so soon.

31:27.270 --> 31:28.000
He's old

31:28.880 --> 31:29.410
and sick.

31:30.580 --> 31:32.180
I won't have to wait too long.

31:33.550 --> 31:35.510
Mrs. Xue, may you realize all your wishes

31:35.510 --> 31:37.110
and live a smooth life forever.

31:37.110 --> 31:38.370
Miss Rong, may you also

31:38.510 --> 31:39.960
realize your lofty ambitions

31:39.960 --> 31:41.490
and make big achievements.

31:49.190 --> 31:52.660
[Imperial Yongguo Mansion]

32:12.030 --> 32:12.560
Let's go.

32:14.770 --> 32:15.570
Let's set off!

32:29.210 --> 32:34.140
♪ Who tears a strand
of light from the dark night? ♪

32:30.510 --> 32:31.550
Master Jianglai, where are you going?

32:31.550 --> 32:32.480
Get out of my way!

32:32.550 --> 32:33.590
Go tell the duke

32:33.590 --> 32:34.750
Master Jianglai is running away!

32:34.750 --> 32:35.160
Yes.

32:35.880 --> 32:37.790
What will be will be.

32:36.000 --> 32:40.990
♪ It jolts my already silent heart
awake ♪

32:37.880 --> 32:38.790
As for those who want to leave,

32:38.790 --> 32:40.390
you can never keep them here.

32:40.400 --> 32:41.400
The substantial wealth

32:41.400 --> 32:42.830
and the duke's power and position
are right there!

32:42.730 --> 32:47.500
♪ The moon hangs bright,
as breezes dance among stars ♪

32:43.000 --> 32:44.640
In this world, whoever treats them as dirt

32:44.640 --> 32:45.640
is just a fool!

32:45.830 --> 32:47.030
A big fool!

32:48.120 --> 32:53.950
♪ Hear the sighs
for the beauty's fleeting years ♪

32:54.820 --> 33:00.860
♪ Lost in the mortal world,
it fades into twilight ♪

32:55.920 --> 32:56.920
Stop right there!

32:57.790 --> 32:58.920
Where are you going?

33:01.370 --> 33:07.410
♪ Grass sprouts, orioles sing,
longevity slips away ♪

33:08.090 --> 33:14.000
♪ Love comes in scattered pairs,
yet thoughts linger on ♪

33:09.480 --> 33:10.080
Jianglai.

33:10.720 --> 33:12.850
You are the heir of the Duke's Mansion.

33:13.510 --> 33:15.190
You have ambitions and courage.

33:14.030 --> 33:20.500
♪ Drifting with the passing years ♪

33:15.210 --> 33:16.660
There are things you're concerned about.

33:16.660 --> 33:17.990
You can't let go of this.

33:18.350 --> 33:19.280
You can't leave.

33:20.930 --> 33:24.280
♪ Flowers bloom and wither,
the sun climbs and falls ♪

33:20.960 --> 33:22.680
This is what you're like indeed.

33:22.680 --> 33:24.370
You can't even walk
without others' help,

33:24.310 --> 33:27.480
♪ True feelings are like drifting mist ♪

33:24.880 --> 33:27.540
but you're still trying to
use Xun to control me.

33:27.750 --> 33:29.030
You clearly know that if I stay,

33:27.780 --> 33:30.030
♪ People only know loneliness ♪

33:29.550 --> 33:30.500
it will lead to another tragedy

33:30.060 --> 33:34.130
♪ Who cares about karma's twist? ♪

33:30.520 --> 33:32.780
of uncle and nephew competing for power.

33:32.800 --> 33:34.270
You have an insatiable desire for power

33:34.270 --> 33:35.270
and are so self-righteous.

33:34.310 --> 33:37.880
♪ Tides ebb and flow,
the moon swells and shrinks ♪

33:35.750 --> 33:36.400
I, Lu Jianglai,

33:36.400 --> 33:37.550
will never bow down

33:37.910 --> 33:40.930
♪ I see through, yet hold my tongue ♪

33:38.030 --> 33:38.960
or submit to you.

33:39.680 --> 33:40.810
If I want something,

33:40.990 --> 33:47.260
♪ Too fragile to be put into words ♪

33:41.030 --> 33:42.160
I will fight for it

33:42.590 --> 33:43.960
and compete for it myself.

33:43.960 --> 33:45.420
I don't need your charity.

33:45.920 --> 33:47.320
I'm not as foolish as you.

33:47.640 --> 33:48.680
You gave up your true love
of this lifetime

33:47.700 --> 33:51.050
♪ Flowers bloom and wither,
the sun climbs and falls ♪

33:49.030 --> 33:50.560
for material possessions.

33:50.680 --> 33:52.350
You don't have anything except power.

33:51.090 --> 33:54.260
♪ True feelings are like drifting mist ♪

33:53.510 --> 33:54.160
You can

33:54.560 --> 33:56.800
♪ People only know loneliness ♪

33:54.880 --> 33:55.680
just stay in

33:55.680 --> 33:57.400
this Duke's Mansion
where everyone resents you

33:56.840 --> 34:00.910
♪ Who cares about karma's twist? ♪

33:57.920 --> 34:00.580
and live as a lonely man
for the rest of your life.

34:01.090 --> 34:04.660
♪ Tides ebb and flow,
the moon swells and shrinks ♪

34:01.270 --> 34:02.880
I only hope that in this lifetime,

34:02.880 --> 34:04.610
our family ties can be severed,

34:04.680 --> 34:05.920
and we'll be strangers when we meet again.

34:04.680 --> 34:07.700
♪ I see through, yet hold my tongue ♪

34:07.000 --> 34:07.600
Jianglai.

34:07.770 --> 34:14.040
♪ Too fragile to be put into words ♪

34:10.110 --> 34:11.030
Stop him!

34:13.760 --> 34:14.670
Stop him!

34:14.760 --> 34:23.460
♪ Too fragile to be put into words ♪

34:19.880 --> 34:21.070
Stop him!

34:22.159 --> 34:23.760
There's no need to chase him.

34:24.130 --> 34:25.460
He will never come back.

34:32.030 --> 34:32.889
Your Highness,

34:33.429 --> 34:34.870
you've lost another son.

34:37.840 --> 34:39.239
What are you waiting for?

34:39.260 --> 34:40.190
The duke is sick.

34:40.520 --> 34:41.920
Carry him inside at once.

34:46.070 --> 34:46.630
What?

34:47.630 --> 34:49.690
Xun is supposed to inherit the title.

34:49.850 --> 34:52.110
Am I not qualified to make this decision?

34:55.800 --> 34:56.400
Yes.

34:57.630 --> 34:59.030
Carry him inside! Hurry!

34:59.290 --> 35:00.550
Don't carry me inside!

35:00.960 --> 35:01.800
Put me down!

35:02.630 --> 35:03.890
Don't carry me inside!

35:04.280 --> 35:06.280
I'm ordering you guys to put me down!

35:07.860 --> 35:09.170
Oh, you, Xue Sangui!

35:10.150 --> 35:11.280
Xue Sangui!

35:12.190 --> 35:13.070
Put me down!

35:13.800 --> 35:14.880
Put me down!

35:15.150 --> 35:17.550
It's time to
announce Master Shuyu's death.

35:17.550 --> 35:18.950
However, it's a pity that

35:19.260 --> 35:20.910
due to his son's sudden death,

35:20.910 --> 35:22.830
the duke was overwhelmed by grief.

35:22.830 --> 35:23.710
Since then,

35:24.220 --> 35:26.220
he has been bedridden with illness.

35:27.110 --> 35:27.760
Yes.

35:28.420 --> 35:30.550
When a parent faces his child's death,

35:31.550 --> 35:33.410
it's also common to feel this way.

35:33.630 --> 35:35.070
It's common to feel this way.

35:35.070 --> 35:35.670
Mother!

35:40.440 --> 35:41.770
All of you may leave now.

35:42.440 --> 35:43.070
Yes.

35:43.320 --> 35:43.920
Xun.

35:47.690 --> 35:48.220
Let's go.

36:27.220 --> 36:30.900
[Capital Dock]

36:32.190 --> 36:33.390
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

36:34.190 --> 36:34.710
Move it over here.

36:34.710 --> 36:35.360
Be careful.

36:35.360 --> 36:35.760
Okay.

36:37.150 --> 36:38.080
Come and help me.

36:38.360 --> 36:38.960
I'm coming!

36:38.960 --> 36:39.620
Be careful!

36:39.880 --> 36:40.480
Over here.

36:42.190 --> 36:42.800
Watch out.

36:43.150 --> 36:43.880
Lady Yunshu.

36:46.320 --> 36:47.420
Lady Yunshu, please wait.

36:47.420 --> 36:49.480
There's something I want to tell you.

36:54.590 --> 36:55.480
Handle it gently.

36:55.480 --> 36:56.920
Mr. Bai is so persistent.

36:58.800 --> 36:59.960
Flowers!

37:00.590 --> 37:02.050
Freshly-picked flowers!

37:02.670 --> 37:03.710
Take a look!

37:04.110 --> 37:05.230
Flowers!

37:05.440 --> 37:06.500
So you're leaving?

37:08.670 --> 37:09.710
The shop issue in the capital

37:09.710 --> 37:10.510
is settled.

37:10.800 --> 37:11.930
It's time to go back.

37:12.710 --> 37:14.190
The Ministry of Personnel...

37:14.190 --> 37:15.360
The Ministry of Personnel has appointed me

37:15.360 --> 37:17.030
as the deputy magistrate of Linji.

37:17.030 --> 37:17.760
Lady Yunshu.

37:18.440 --> 37:21.030
Is ranking seventh in the second tier
of the latest imperial exam good enough

37:21.030 --> 37:23.960
to let me stand in the mud
and shield you from the wind?

37:24.280 --> 37:26.480
-I once told you...
-You once told me...

37:26.480 --> 37:27.070
You were

37:27.070 --> 37:28.870
a wild water weed growing in mud,

37:29.590 --> 37:30.280
but I insisted on

37:30.280 --> 37:32.280
nurturing you in celadon porcelain.

37:32.280 --> 37:33.080
But in the end,

37:33.360 --> 37:35.230
you turned out to be
a thorny water caltrop vine.

37:35.230 --> 37:37.030
While trying to ferry you,
my boat capsized.

37:37.030 --> 37:39.560
My ankles
got tangled in water weeds instead.

37:39.590 --> 37:40.760
Now I understand.

37:41.710 --> 37:43.460
Since you want to fully bloom in the mud,

37:43.460 --> 37:44.050
then I'll

37:44.710 --> 37:45.800
be that mud for you.

37:49.410 --> 37:50.870
The Ministry of Personnel
has issued the official documents.

37:50.870 --> 37:52.130
I'll depart in 10 days.

37:58.480 --> 37:59.610
It's rainy in Linji,

38:00.070 --> 38:02.670
which is perfect
for wild weeds to grow lushly.

38:06.600 --> 38:07.160
You fool,

38:07.660 --> 38:08.590
don't follow me.

38:10.180 --> 38:11.240
I won't follow you.

38:16.130 --> 38:20.960
♪ The moonlight chases its way
up to the mountain peak ♪

38:17.030 --> 38:18.830
I'll be waiting for you in Linji.

38:23.180 --> 38:28.680
♪ I lift my head and see the faint trace
of spring snow on your brow ♪

38:23.360 --> 38:24.000
Okay.

38:30.540 --> 38:35.940
♪ Years of being buried
in paperwork and official business ♪

38:38.320 --> 38:43.700
♪ Who makes the kite snap its string? ♪

38:39.150 --> 38:40.480
What are you looking at?

38:40.630 --> 38:41.760
Stop being in a daze.

38:45.410 --> 38:50.860
♪ Fate must intend for us
to be bound together ♪

38:46.010 --> 38:46.660
Let's go.

38:52.440 --> 38:58.030
♪ That's why so many challenges are set ♪

38:53.960 --> 38:54.760
Lady Shanbao.

38:55.070 --> 38:56.030
Rong Shanbao!

38:59.670 --> 39:04.900
♪ I can never get enough of looking ♪

39:05.950 --> 39:12.190
♪ At this charming
and enchanting smiling face ♪

39:13.410 --> 39:20.070
♪ I cross mountains and rivers
to rush to your presence ♪

39:20.560 --> 39:26.860
♪ We face each other, tears
streaming down, yet unable to speak ♪

39:22.190 --> 39:23.590
Are you here to see me off?

39:25.760 --> 39:27.420
I'll go back to Linji with you.

39:27.810 --> 39:33.960
♪ Afraid that the dream is just a sham,
frightening away the pair of swallows ♪

39:34.910 --> 39:41.930
♪ Can we, in this lifetime,
share the moon's beauty from afar? ♪

39:35.710 --> 39:37.550
What nonsense are you talking about?

39:37.550 --> 39:38.710
Don't you want your title?

39:38.710 --> 39:40.000
Don't you want to uphold justice?

39:40.000 --> 39:42.130
Can you even let go
of your dear nephew?

39:42.230 --> 39:43.280
Even if you could let it all go,

39:42.390 --> 39:49.460
♪ The myriad stars in the sky
can't fully convey our endless affection ♪

39:43.510 --> 39:44.360
I could not.

39:44.960 --> 39:46.280
I don't want to watch you

39:46.280 --> 39:49.030
grow old and ugly
and fall in love with someone else.

39:49.030 --> 39:50.510
I disdain to make empty promises

39:49.620 --> 39:56.970
♪ The wind wafts
in countless thoughts of longing ♪

39:50.920 --> 39:52.110
of eternal love.

39:57.010 --> 40:03.340
♪ Love exists among mountains and rivers.
Who says it couldn't be fully achieved? ♪

39:58.610 --> 40:00.410
I'm placing myself in your palm.

40:01.760 --> 40:03.160
Then I can never fly away.

40:04.220 --> 40:10.840
♪ Every single day with you
feels like our very first encounter ♪

40:04.490 --> 40:05.550
If one day, I really

40:05.940 --> 40:07.560
become someone like those who are

40:07.560 --> 40:10.130
cold-hearted, vulgar and hypocritical,

40:10.620 --> 40:11.820
making you loathe me,

40:13.850 --> 40:16.050
then please kill me with your own hands.

40:16.130 --> 40:16.940
I'd rather die

40:17.260 --> 40:18.490
than become

40:18.740 --> 40:19.910
such a mediocre, dull,

40:19.910 --> 40:21.280
selfish and annoying person.

40:21.280 --> 40:22.870
I won't become a soulless puppet

40:22.870 --> 40:23.870
that is corrupted

40:24.340 --> 40:26.070
and driven by power and desire.

40:26.710 --> 40:27.510
Rong Shanbao.

40:27.840 --> 40:28.970
If I keep loving you,

40:29.270 --> 40:30.200
protecting you,

40:30.260 --> 40:32.070
sticking to my original intentions

40:32.070 --> 40:34.200
and being a good official
who upholds justice for the people,

40:34.200 --> 40:34.760
then...

40:37.120 --> 40:39.150
please love and cherish me
for the rest of your life too

40:39.150 --> 40:40.680
and stay by my side forever.

40:41.510 --> 40:43.260
Don't speak of separation again.

40:43.260 --> 40:45.060
Nor can you complain that I'm old

40:45.440 --> 40:46.000
and ugly.

40:55.800 --> 40:57.840
Lord Lu is so affectionate.

40:59.760 --> 41:01.160
♪ Stars and the moon descended ♪

41:01.420 --> 41:06.570
♪ Falling Into the mortal world
to make flowers wither and hearts break ♪

41:01.810 --> 41:02.610
Stop talking.

41:02.810 --> 41:04.740
You're becoming a laughing stock.

41:05.940 --> 41:06.940
Then take me back home with you.

41:06.710 --> 41:08.460
♪ How persistent ♪

41:08.480 --> 41:13.100
♪ How can such a fleeting grace
be forgotten? ♪

41:08.800 --> 41:10.630
If you want to go back, just go back.

41:10.630 --> 41:12.090
No one can stop you anyway.

41:13.780 --> 41:15.600
♪ Beacon fires rose high ♪

41:15.620 --> 41:21.330
♪ With one more dance,
the music is over and people are gone ♪

41:21.150 --> 41:22.280
The gangplank is too slippery.

41:22.280 --> 41:23.070
Let me carry you onto the ship.

41:22.650 --> 41:27.140
♪ We found another crescent moon ♪

41:23.480 --> 41:24.740
This is so inappropriate.

41:24.740 --> 41:25.940
Put me down right now.

41:34.780 --> 41:35.910
When we reach Linji,

41:36.480 --> 41:38.630
I won't allow you to be so impudent again.

41:38.630 --> 41:39.960
Then I'll listen to you, Lady Shanbao.

41:39.960 --> 41:41.220
Let's return to Linji.

41:48.760 --> 41:49.400
Mr. Lu!

41:50.230 --> 41:50.800
Wait!

41:51.000 --> 41:51.630
Mr. Lu!

41:52.030 --> 41:53.290
I haven't boarded yet!

41:53.650 --> 41:54.340
Wait!

41:56.030 --> 41:56.960
Let's leave at once.

41:56.960 --> 41:58.510
The annoying men are coming.

41:58.510 --> 41:59.110
Set sail!

42:01.190 --> 42:01.840
Wait!

42:17.030 --> 42:17.710
Speaking of which, I wonder

42:17.710 --> 42:18.770
who was so kind to me

42:19.190 --> 42:20.590
and was afraid that I couldn't make it,

42:20.590 --> 42:21.190
specially leaving

42:21.190 --> 42:22.220
a fast horse to me.

42:22.930 --> 42:23.550
Shut up!

42:25.070 --> 42:26.890
You've chosen this path yourself.

42:26.890 --> 42:27.680
You can't blame me now.
